      "comment": "Performs inverse discrete cosine transform (IDCT) using indexed coefficient table lookup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate coefficient table offset: nTableIndex * 0x100 (256 bytes per table)\n2. Compute table address: g_adDctCoefficientTables + offset\n3. Call InverseDiscreteCosineTransform with input data, stride, output buffer, and coefficient table\n4. Return to caller (no return value)\n\nParameters:\n- pbInputData: Pointer to input byte data for DCT processing\n- nStride: Row stride/pitch for accessing input data matrix  \n- pwOutputBuffer: Pointer to output buffer for transformed 16-bit values\n- nTableIndex: Index into coefficient table array (0-3 for 4 available tables)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Coefficient table stride is fixed at 256 bytes (64 integers * 4 bytes)\n- Function assumes valid table index (no bounds checking performed)\n- Input data cast from int to byte* for DCT processing\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x100 (256): Size in bytes of each DCT coefficient table\n- 0x100231dc: Base address of g_adDctCoefficientTables array\n\nStructure Layout:\ng_adDctCoefficientTables[4] - Array of 4 DCT coefficient tables\nOffset | Size | Field Name    | Type   | Description\n-------|------|---------------|--------|-------------\n0x000  | 256  | Table0[64]    | int[64]| DCT coefficients for table 0\n0x100  | 256  | Table1[64]    | int[64]| DCT coefficients for table 1  \n0x200  | 256  | Table2[64]    | int[64]| DCT coefficients for table 2\n0x300  | 256  | Table3[64]    | int[64]| DCT coefficients for table 3",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
