      "name": "ProcessHuffmanDecodeTables",
      "signature": "void ProcessHuffmanDecodeTables(int nPlaneContext, BitStream * pBitStream, HuffmanDecodeContext * pDecodeContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Process all Huffman decode tables for a video plane\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize table pointer to decode context length tables at offset 0x140\n2. Initialize symbol buffer pointer to start of decode context \n3. Set loop counter to 16 (0x10) for processing 16 Huffman tables\n4. For each of 16 tables:\n   a. Call DecodeHuffmanSymbols with bit stream, length table, symbol count, and buffer\n   b. Advance length table pointer by 4 bytes (next uint entry)\n   c. Advance symbol buffer pointer by 16 bytes (0x10) \n   d. Decrement counter and continue if not zero\n5. Process final Huffman table using plane context structure:\n   a. Extract length table from plane context at offset 0x24\n   b. Extract symbol count from plane context at offset 0x20  \n   c. Extract symbol buffer from plane context at offset 0x10\n   d. Call DecodeHuffmanSymbols with these parameters\n6. Clear status field in decode context at offset 0x180 to 0\n\nParameters:\n- nPlaneContext (int): Plane processing context structure containing final decode table\n- pBitStream (BitStream *): Input bit stream for Huffman symbol decoding\n- pDecodeContext (HuffmanDecodeContext *): Decode context with 16 symbol tables and status\n\nReturns:\n- void: No return value, modifies decode context in place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Processes exactly 16 fixed Huffman tables plus 1 plane-specific table\n- Magic number 0x10: Number of standard Huffman decode tables\n- Magic number 0x140: Offset to length tables array in decode context\n- Magic number 0x180: Offset to status field in decode context\n\nStructure Layout:\nHuffmanDecodeContext (388 bytes total):\nOffset  Size  Field Name       Type       Description\n0x000   320   abSymbolBuffers  byte[320]  16 symbol buffers, 20 bytes each\n0x140   64    adwLengthTables  uint[16]   Length tables for Huffman decoding  \n0x180   4     dwStatus         uint       Processing status flag\n\nPlane Context Structure:\nOffset  Size  Field Name       Type       Description\n0x010   ?     pbSymbolBuffer   byte*      Final symbol buffer\n0x020   4     pdwSymbolCount   uint*      Symbol count for final table\n0x024   4     pdwLengthTable   uint*      Length table for final decode",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
