      "name": "ExpandIndexedPixels2x2",
      "signature": "int ExpandIndexedPixels2x2(int param_1, int param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Expands indexed color pixels to 2x2 blocks in the destination buffer.\n\nReads byte indices from two source streams (g_pDstBufferCurrent and g_pDstBufferEnd),\nlooks up each index in g_anLookupTable to get a 32-bit color value, then writes that\ncolor to a 2x2 pixel block (4 pixels total) in the destination buffers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Loop nPixelCount times\n2. For each iteration:\n   a. Read byte index from g_pDstBufferCurrent, advance pointer by 1\n   b. Look up color in g_anLookupTable[index]\n   c. Write color to 2x2 block at g_pSrcBufferCurrent (using g_dwPixelStride for row offset)\n   d. Read byte index from g_pDstBufferEnd, advance pointer by 1\n   e. Look up color in g_anLookupTable[index]\n   f. Write color to 2x2 block at g_pSrcBufferEnd (using g_dwPixelStride for row offset)\n   g. Advance destination pointers by 8 bytes (2 dwords = 2 pixels horizontally)\n3. Return nPixelCount + nRowOffset\n\nParameters:\n  nPixelCount - Number of pixel pairs to process per row\n  nRowOffset - Row offset value added to result (used for position tracking)\n\nReturns:\n  Sum of nPixelCount and nRowOffset (typically used for buffer position calculation)\n\nGlobal Data Referenced:\n  g_pDstBufferCurrent (0x100332e8) - Source byte stream pointer 1\n  g_pDstBufferEnd (0x100332ec) - Source byte stream pointer 2\n  g_pSrcBufferCurrent (0x100332e0) - Destination pixel buffer pointer 1\n  g_pSrcBufferEnd (0x100332e4) - Destination pixel buffer pointer 2\n  g_dwPixelStride (0x1003331c) - Row stride in bytes for vertical offset\n  g_anLookupTable (0x1003674c) - 256-entry color lookup table",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:37cf005d9389db8282cc86423d434488a2d849f76154442298ba13db6478de17",
