      "name": "ConvertYUVToRGB24Scanline",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYUVToRGB24Scanline(uint param_1, int param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts a scanline of YUV 4:2:0 video data to packed 24-bit RGB pixels.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. For each pixel in the scanline (nPixelCount iterations):\n   a. Read U and V chroma values from chroma buffers\n   b. Look up color conversion indices from YUV lookup tables\n   c. Read luminance (Y) value from destination buffer\n   d. Convert luminance to base lookup table offset\n   e. Combine R, G, B components using lookup tables into packed RGB\n   f. Write packed RGB to source buffer and stride-offset location\n   g. Advance chroma pointers every 2 pixels (4:2:0 subsampling)\n2. Return when all pixels processed\n\nParameters:\n  dwStartPixelIndex - Starting pixel index (used for chroma subsampling alignment)\n  nPixelCount - Number of pixels to convert in this scanline\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns immediately if nPixelCount is 0\n  - Chroma buffers advance only on even pixel boundaries (4:2:0 subsampling)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x1 - Bitmask for odd/even pixel check (chroma subsampling)\n  0x8 - Shift amount for packing RGB components (8 bits per channel)\n  0x4 - Pointer stride for DWORD-aligned pixel access\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Packed RGB format: 0x00RRGGBB (24-bit RGB in 32-bit DWORD)\n  - Bits 23-16: Red component\n  - Bits 15-8: Green component  \n  - Bits 7-0: Blue component\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\n  g_pChromaBufferU/V - Pointers to U and V chroma plane data\n  g_pDstBufferCurrent - Pointer to luminance (Y) plane data\n  g_pSrcBufferCurrent - Output pointer for converted RGB pixels\n  g_dwPixelStride - Stride for writing duplicate scanline (interlacing)\n  g_adYToRedLookupTable - Y to red index lookup (256 entries)\n  g_adYToGreenLookupTable - Y to green index lookup (256 entries)\n  g_adUToBlueLookupTable - U to blue contribution lookup (256 entries)\n  g_adVToRedLookupTable - V to red contribution lookup (256 entries)\n  g_adLuminanceBaseLookupTable - Base address for luminance conversion",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
