      "name": "ConvertYuvToRgb16WithVerticalDouble",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYuvToRgb16WithVerticalDouble(uint param_1, int param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts YUV 4:2:2 color data to RGB16 format with vertical line doubling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Exit early if pixel count is zero\n2. For each pixel in the scanline:\n   a. Look up Y-to-Red coefficient from U chroma value\n   b. Calculate Y-to-Green index from U and V chroma values\n   c. Look up V-to-Red coefficient from V chroma value\n   d. Read luminance (Y) byte and advance source pointer\n   e. Compute YUV base coefficient from luminance\n   f. Combine R, G, B components using shifted lookup tables into RGB16\n   g. Write RGB16 pixel to current scanline\n   h. Write same RGB16 pixel to next scanline (vertical doubling)\n   i. Advance destination pointer by 2 bytes (16-bit pixel)\n   j. Increment pixel index; advance chroma pointers every 2 pixels (4:2:2)\n3. Continue until all pixels processed\n\nParameters:\n  dwPixelIndex - Starting pixel index (used for chroma subsampling alignment)\n  nPixelCount - Number of pixels to convert\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Chroma pointers (U/V) advance every 2 pixels due to 4:2:2 subsampling\n  - Same pixel written twice for vertical 2x scaling (interlace compensation)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1 - Mask for odd/even pixel check (chroma subsampling)\n  0x2 - RGB16 pixel stride in bytes\n\nStructure Layout (Global State):\n  Offset  Size  Field                    Type      Description\n  0x00    4     g_pSrcBufferCurrent      uint*     Current RGB destination pointer\n  0x08    4     g_pDstBufferCurrent      uint*     Current Y (luminance) source pointer\n  0x10    4     g_pChromaBufferU         uint*     Current U chroma source pointer\n  0x14    4     g_pChromaBufferV         uint*     Current V chroma source pointer\n  0x1C    4     g_nYToRedIndex           int       Cached Y-to-Red lookup index\n  0x18    4     g_nYToGreenIndex         int       Cached Y-to-Green lookup index\n  0x20    4     g_nVToRedIndex           int       Cached V-to-Red lookup index\n  0x3C    4     g_dwPixelStride          uint      Bytes between scanlines",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
