      "name": "ConvertYuvToRgb16DoubledPair",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYuvToRgb16DoubledPair(int param_1, uint param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts YUV 4:2:0 pixel pairs to 16-bit RGB565 with horizontal doubling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. For each pixel pair iteration:\n   a. Look up U channel contribution to red from g_adYToRedLookupTable\n   b. Look up U channel contribution to green + V blue from combined tables\n   c. Look up V channel contribution to red from g_adVToRedLookupTable\n2. Read first Y (luma) value from current destination buffer\n3. Compute YUV base coefficient from luma lookup table\n4. Combine R, G, B components via OR of 16-bit lookup values\n5. Write doubled pixel (same value to adjacent pixels for 2x horizontal scale)\n6. Repeat steps 2-5 for second Y value from end buffer\n7. Advance output pointers by 4 bytes (2 pixels x 2 bytes each)\n8. Every 2nd iteration, advance chroma (U/V) pointers (4:2:0 subsampling)\n9. Loop until nPixelPairCount reaches zero\n\nParameters:\n  nPixelPairCount - Number of pixel pairs to convert (loop counter)\n  dwStartPixelIndex - Starting pixel index, used to track odd/even for chroma advance\n\nReturns:\n  void - Output written directly to global buffer pointers\n\nGlobal Buffer Pointers:\n  g_pSrcBufferCurrent - Output RGB16 buffer (first scanline)\n  g_pSrcBufferEnd - Output RGB16 buffer (second scanline for doubling)\n  g_pDstBufferCurrent - Input Y (luma) buffer for first pixel\n  g_pDstBufferEnd - Input Y (luma) buffer for second pixel\n  g_pChromaBufferU - Input U (Cb) chroma buffer\n  g_pChromaBufferV - Input V (Cr) chroma buffer\n\nGlobal Index Cache:\n  g_nYToRedIndex - Cached red contribution from U channel\n  g_nYToGreenIndex - Cached green contribution (U+V combined)\n  g_nVToRedIndex - Cached red contribution from V channel\n\nLookup Tables:\n  g_adYToRedLookupTable - U to red component mapping (256 entries)\n  g_adYToGreenLookupTable - U to green component mapping (256 entries)\n  g_adUToBlueLookupTable - V to blue component mapping (256 entries)\n  g_adVToRedLookupTable - V to red component mapping (256 entries)\n  g_anYuvBaseCoefficients - Y value to base coefficient (256 entries)\n  g_awRedComponentLookup - Final red component 16-bit values\n  g_awGreenComponentLookup - Final green component 16-bit values\n  g_awBlueComponentLookup - Final blue component 16-bit values\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Chroma subsampling: U/V pointers advance every 2 pixels (4:2:0 format)\n  Horizontal doubling: Each computed RGB16 value written twice adjacently",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
