      "name": "ConvertYuvToRgb16Doubled",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYuvToRgb16Doubled(int param_1, uint param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Convert YUV pixel pairs to 16-bit RGB with 2x2 pixel doubling\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load chroma indices from U and V buffers, fetch color component lookup offsets\n2. Compute intermediate color indices: Y-to-Red, Y-to-Green + U-to-Blue, V-to-Red\n3. For each luminance sample pair in the loop:\n   a. Read Y sample from source buffer, increment pointer\n   b. Lookup luminance-to-index conversion value\n   c. OR together Red, Green, Blue 16-bit components from lookup tables\n   d. Write same RGB pixel to 2x2 block (current + current+2 + stride + stride+2)\n4. Repeat for second luminance sample of the pair\n5. Every other iteration (when index is even), advance chroma pointers by 1\n6. Decrement pixel pair count and loop until zero\n\nParameters:\nnPixelPairCount (int): Number of pixel pairs to convert (loop counter)\ndwStartIndex (uint): Starting pixel index for chroma subsampling sync\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Writes directly to destination RGB buffer via global pointers\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Chroma subsampling: U and V pointers advance every 2 luminance samples (4:2:0)\n- Pixel doubling: Each source pixel is written to a 2x2 block in destination\n- All memory access via global buffer pointers set up by caller\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x4: Pixel stride in bytes (2 pixels * 2 bytes per 16-bit pixel)\n0x2: Offset to adjacent horizontal pixel\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\ng_pChromaBufferU: Pointer to U chroma plane\ng_pChromaBufferV: Pointer to V chroma plane\ng_pDstBufferCurrent: Pointer to current Y luminance sample\ng_pDstBufferEnd: Pointer to second Y luminance sample\ng_pSrcBufferCurrent: Destination RGB pointer for first pixel\ng_pSrcBufferEnd: Destination RGB pointer for second pixel\ng_dwPixelStride: Stride to next row in destination buffer\ng_adYToRedLookupTable: Y component to red index lookup\ng_adYToGreenLookupTable: Y component to green index lookup\ng_adUToBlueLookupTable: U component to blue index lookup\ng_adVToRedLookupTable: V component to red index lookup\ng_awRedComponentLookup: Final red 16-bit component table\ng_awGreenComponentLookup: Final green 16-bit component table\ng_awBlueComponentLookup: Final blue 16-bit component table\ng_anLuminanceToIndexLookup: Luminance to table index conversion",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
