      "name": "ConvertYuvToRgb16Pixels",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYuvToRgb16Pixels(int param_1, uint param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts YUV 4:2:0 planar pixels to 16-bit RGB (RGB565 format).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load U/V chroma samples from global buffers\n2. Compute color conversion indices via lookup tables for Y-to-Red, Y-to-Green, U-to-Blue, V-to-Red\n3. For each pixel pair:\n   a. Read Y (luma) sample from destination buffer\n   b. Index into YUV base coefficient table using luma value\n   c. Combine R/G/B shifted lookup values via bitwise OR to form RGB565 pixel\n   d. Write 16-bit RGB value to source buffer position\n4. Advance chroma pointers every 2 pixels (4:2:0 subsampling)\n5. Decrement pixel count and loop until exhausted\n\nParameters:\n  nPixelCount - Number of pixel pairs to convert (decremented to 0)\n  dwStartIndex - Starting pixel index (used for chroma subsampling phase)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Chroma buffers (U/V) advance every other pixel due to 4:2:0 chroma subsampling\n  - Uses (dwStartIndex & 1) to determine chroma advance timing\n\nGlobal State Accessed:\n  g_pChromaBufferU, g_pChromaBufferV - YUV chroma plane pointers\n  g_pDstBufferCurrent, g_pDstBufferEnd - Y luma source pointers\n  g_pSrcBufferCurrent, g_pSrcBufferEnd - RGB destination pointers\n  g_adYToRedLookupTable, g_adYToGreenLookupTable - Color conversion LUTs\n  g_adUToBlueLookupTable, g_adVToRedLookupTable - Chroma LUTs\n  g_anYuvBaseCoefficients - Base coefficient array\n  g_adRedShiftedLookup, g_adGreenShiftedLookup, g_adBlueShiftedLookup - Pre-shifted RGB LUTs",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
