      "name": "PackYuvToUyvyDualScanline",
      "signature": "undefined PackYuvToUyvyDualScanline(undefined4 param_1, uint param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Packs YUV planar data into UYVY packed format and writes to dual scanlines.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pixel pair count is at least 2 (early exit if less)\n2. Calculate loop iterations as pixelCount / 2 (processing pixel pairs)\n3. For each pixel pair iteration:\n   a. Read two Y (luma) bytes from g_pDstBufferCurrent\n   b. Read one U byte from g_pChromaBufferU\n   c. Read one V byte from g_pChromaBufferV\n   d. Pack into UYVY format: [U][Y0][V][Y1] as 32-bit value\n   e. Write packed pixel to g_pSrcBufferCurrent\n   f. Duplicate to next scanline using g_dwPixelStride offset\n   g. Advance all buffer pointers\n\nParameters:\n  pbUnused (byte*): Unused parameter (possibly legacy interface)\n  dwPixelPairCount (uint): Number of pixels to process (must be >= 2)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If dwPixelPairCount < 2, function returns immediately without processing\n  - Loop count is dwPixelPairCount >> 1 (integer division by 2)\n\nStructure Layout (UYVY packed pixel):\n  Offset | Size | Field | Type   | Description\n  -------|------|-------|--------|-------------\n  0x00   | 1    | U     | byte   | Chroma U component\n  0x01   | 1    | Y0    | byte   | First luma sample\n  0x02   | 1    | V     | byte   | Chroma V component\n  0x03   | 1    | Y1    | byte   | Second luma sample\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\n  g_pDstBufferCurrent - Source Y (luma) buffer pointer\n  g_pChromaBufferU - Source U chroma buffer pointer\n  g_pChromaBufferV - Source V chroma buffer pointer\n  g_pSrcBufferCurrent - Destination packed pixel buffer pointer\n  g_dwPixelStride - Scanline stride for vertical duplication",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:26661397e68084f592b6b28af201477169d810527cc8da38465adae6eab31cf9",
