      "name": "ConvertYUVToPackedPixels",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYUVToPackedPixels(undefined4 param_1, uint param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts YUV planar data to packed UYVY or similar 32-bit pixel format.\n\nReads luma (Y) data from g_pDstBufferCurrent (2 bytes per iteration),\nchroma U from g_pChromaBufferU (1 byte), and chroma V from g_pChromaBufferV\n(1 byte). Combines into 32-bit packed pixels written to g_pSrcBufferCurrent.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pixel count >= 2\n2. Calculate iterations as dwPixelCount / 2 (processes 2 Y samples per iteration)\n3. For each iteration:\n   a. Read Y0 and Y1 from luma buffer (2 bytes, advance by 2)\n   b. Read V from chroma V buffer (1 byte, advance by 1)\n   c. Read U from chroma U buffer (1 byte, advance by 1)\n   d. Pack as: [Y1][V][Y0][U] into 32-bit value\n   e. Write packed pixel to output, advance output by 4 bytes\n\nParameters:\n- pUnused: void* - Unused parameter (possibly reserved for future use)\n- dwPixelCount: uint - Number of pixels to process (must be >= 2)\n\nReturns: void\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_pDstBufferCurrent: Advanced by dwPixelCount bytes\n- g_pChromaBufferU: Advanced by dwPixelCount/2 bytes\n- g_pChromaBufferV: Advanced by dwPixelCount/2 bytes\n- g_pSrcBufferCurrent: Advanced by dwPixelCount/2 dwords\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If dwPixelCount < 2, function returns immediately without processing\n\nPacked Pixel Format (UYVY-style):\nByte 0: U (chroma blue)\nByte 1: Y0 (first luma sample)\nByte 2: V (chroma red)\nByte 3: Y1 (second luma sample)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:8cfe7265d7634c9c8dd03c6b1005c55614a0ac3ad8fc3377f941f8823a88bf5a",
