      "name": "ConvertYuvToRgbScanlineSimd",
      "signature": "void ConvertYuvToRgbScanlineSimd(int nScanlineIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Convert YUV color data to RGB format using MMX SIMD operations for one scanline.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Setup scanline boundaries using nScanlineIndex offset (6 pixels per unit)\n2. Process first scanline half: load YUV data, extract luma components, apply color conversion lookup tables, pack RGB pixels\n3. Process second scanline half using identical algorithm with different buffers\n4. Return void\n\nParameters:\nnScanlineIndex (int): Zero-based scanline index for offset calculation\n\nReturns:\nvoid: No return value\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x6: Pixels per scanline unit\n0x00FF00FF: Luma component extraction mask\n0x18, 0x10, 0x8: Bit shifts for pixel byte extraction",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
