      "name": "GetCurrentIteratorItem",
      "signature": "undefined4 GetCurrentIteratorItem(int param_1, undefined4 * param_2, undefined4 * param_3)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Retrieves the current item from an iterator structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if iterator index (offset 0x48) is valid (!= -1)\n2. If invalid, return 0 (no current item)\n3. Read item value from array at offset 0x3c indexed by current position\n4. Read item data from offset 0x4c\n5. Store values to output pointers and return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  pIterator     - void*  - Pointer to iterator structure containing:\n                           - 0x3c: Array of item values (uint[])\n                           - 0x48: Current index (-1 = invalid)\n                           - 0x4c: Current item data\n  pdwItemValue  - uint*  - Output: receives current item value from array\n  pdwItemData   - uint*  - Output: receives current item data\n\nReturns:\n  1 (TRUE)  - Success, current item retrieved\n  0 (FALSE) - Failure, iterator index is invalid (-1)\n\nStructure Layout (Iterator):\n  Offset  Size  Field         Type    Description\n  0x3c    var   aItemValues   uint[]  Array of item values\n  0x48    4     nCurrentIndex int     Current position (-1 = invalid)\n  0x4c    4     dwItemData    uint    Associated data for current item",
